    {
        "content": "<p>I'm not sure how related this is, but there are also some problems interacting with the module system, like at <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"595625\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/595625-nightly-testing-mathlib/topic/nightly-testing.20regression.20log/with/598008154\">#nightly-testing-mathlib &gt; nightly-testing regression log</a>. Could something analogous to this be the issue?</p>",
